### Refresh token rotation (senior)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{seniorRefreshToken}}"
}

### Refresh token rotation (volunteer)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{volunteerRefreshToken}}"
}

### Refresh token rotation (police)
# Police accounts are not issued refresh tokens -> this returns 400/401
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{policeRefreshToken}}"
}

### Logout / revoke refresh token (senior)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{seniorRefreshToken}}"
}

### Logout / revoke refresh token (volunteer)
